\ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\ src/frifold.fam — radix-8 FRI fold step over BabyBear BB4 (Stage 2 of the FRI
\ verifier). Folds f on a size-8 coset C = s*<w8> into its degree-<8 interpolant
\ evaluated at the EF challenge: eval_out = P(beta), P interpolating the 8 coset
\ evals. Equivalently, with x = beta*s_inv:
\   coeffs[m] = sum_i evals[i] * w8^(-m*bitrev3(i) mod 8)     (unnormalized iDFT)
\   eval_out  = (1/8) * sum_m coeffs[m] * x^m                 (Horner in BB4)
\ evals = 8 BB4 in BIT-REVERSED order (evals[i] = f(s*w8^bitrev3(i))), s_inv=1/s
\ (base scalar), beta = BB4 challenge. w8 = 0x5EE99486 (prim 8th root, 31^((p-1)/8);
\ w8^4 = -1). Built on bb4.fam (compile AFTER it). NO alloc-per-call: scr>=0xF0.
\ Python ref + cross-check vs Lagrange: tmp/pos2/frifoldref.py.
\ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

: frifold ( evals s_inv beta out scr -- )
  \ x = beta * s_inv
  2 lit pick  4 lit pick  2 lit pick  bb4smul
